{"strongs": "H5121", "word": "נוית", "translit": "na.vit", "root": "נוית", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, of a location", "gloss": "in Ramah", "definition": "נוית Kt (i.e. נָוִית , or נָָֽוְיַת , Ginsb ), נָיוֺת Qr ; probably proper name, of a location in Ramah (possibly = habitations , but dubious, see Dr 1Sam 19:18 HPS ); — adode of prophets 1Sam 19:18 ; 1Sam 19:19 ; 1Sam 19:22 ; 1Sam 19:23 (twice in verse) and 1Sam 20:1 (where Baer נוות Kt ); followed by בָּרָמָה (except 1Sam 19:18 ); ᵐ5 Ἀυαθ ( ν dropped out after ἐν ), so ᵐ5 L A Ναυιωθ .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5048')\">BDB5048</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5121')\">H5121</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5047')\">BDB5047</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5049')\">BDB5049</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>נוית</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> (i.e. <bdbheb>נָוִית</bdbheb>, or <bdbheb>נָָֽוְיַת</bdbheb>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gi')\">Ginsb</lookup>), <bdbheb>נָיוֺת</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup>; probably <b>proper name, of a location</b> <highlightword>in Ramah</highlightword> (possibly = <highlight>habitations</highlight>, but dubious, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup><ref ref=\"1Sam 19:18\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(9,19,18)\">1Sam 19:18</ref></sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('HPS')\">HPS</lookup>); — adode of prophets <ref ref=\"1Sam 19:18\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(9,19,18)\">1Sam 19:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 19:19\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(9,19,19)\">1Sam 19:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 19:22\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(9,19,22)\">1Sam 19:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 19:23\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"23\" oncli